## Design System — Exact Port from Waitlist Site

The waitlist site uses a **dual-axis theme**: `data-theme` (light/dark) × `data-accent` (sand/rose/sky/lavender/honey). This gives **10 theme combinations**. The values below are copied verbatim from [index.css](file:///e:/Candor/candor/src/index.css).

### Theme Architecture for React Native

Since RN doesn't have CSS variables, we convert to a `ThemeColors` object per combo. The HSL values from `index.css` are pre-computed to hex/rgba at build time.

**Key tokens per theme:**
- `background`, `surface`, `surfaceSecondary`
- `foreground`, `foregroundSecondary`
- `accent`, `accentForeground`
- `primary`, `primaryForeground`
- `card`, `cardForeground`
- `border`, `input`
- `muted`, `mutedForeground`

**Font**: DM Sans (light 300, regular 400, medium 500) — matching `@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans...')` from the source

**Transitions**: 600ms ease on all color properties (matching `[data-theme] * { transition: ... 600ms ease }`)

