### Phase 2 — Theme System (exact port from waitlist)

#### [MODIFY] [theme.ts](file:///e:/Candor/candorapp/utils/theme.ts)
Complete rewrite — port all 10 theme combos from [index.css](file:///e:/Candor/candor/src/index.css):

Structure:
```typescript
type ThemeMode = 'light' | 'dark';
type ThemeAccent = 'sand' | 'rose' | 'sky' | 'lavender' | 'honey';

// Pre-computed HSL → hex for each combo
const themes: Record<`${ThemeMode}-${ThemeAccent}`, ThemeColors> = { ... };
```

Each `ThemeColors` contains the exact tokens from CSS:
- Sand dark default: bg `hsl(24,12%,9%)`, surface `hsl(24,10%,12%)`, fg `hsl(30,16%,90%)`
- Rose light: bg `hsl(355,40%,95%)`, surface `hsl(352,35%,92%)`, fg `hsl(0,8%,28%)`
- etc. (all 10 combos from index.css)

Also includes:
- `Typography` using DM Sans (300/400/500 weights)
- `Shadows.soft` matching `.soft-shadow { box-shadow: 0 8px 40px -12px ... }`
- `Radius` matching tailwind `--radius` + extensions (2xl, 3xl)

#### [NEW] [useTheme.tsx](file:///e:/Candor/candorapp/hooks/useTheme.tsx)
Port of [ThemeContext.tsx](file:///e:/Candor/candor/src/contexts/ThemeContext.tsx):
- `useTheme()` → `{ mode, setMode, accent, setAccent, colors }`
- Default: `dark` mode, `sand` accent (matching waitlist)
- Persists to AsyncStorage/localStorage (with SSR guard)
- `accents` array with `lightColor`/`darkColor` (from the exact values in ThemeContext.tsx)

#### [NEW] [ThemeSelector.tsx](file:///e:/Candor/candorapp/components/ThemeSelector.tsx)
Port of [ThemeSwitcher.tsx](file:///e:/Candor/candor/src/components/ThemeSwitcher.tsx):
- Moon/Sun toggle for mode (left side)
- Vertical divider
- 5 colored dots (sand, rose, sky, lavender, honey)
- Active dot has accent-colored ring
- Uses `Animated` for spring-like indicator (replacing framer-motion)

