## Verification Plan

### Automated
- Backend: hit `/analyze` with 12-message history → valid JSON schema
- Backend: hit `/compatibility` → score ∈ [0,1], reason non-empty
- Frontend: theme switch doesn't flash (600ms transition)

### Manual
- Chat 12+ messages → analysis triggers without interruption
- Switch all 10 theme combos → verify consistency with becandor.vercel.app
- Match unlock → soft reveal, no raw data shown
